WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:03.836
[smooth jazz music]

00:00:03.869 --> 00:00:07.807
♪ ♪

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.075
[in Jamaican accents]
- SUE!

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:11.778
OH, MY GOODNESS.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.813 line:92%
OH, MY GOODNESS.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.648
HOW ARE YOU DOING, GIRL?

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.751
- OH, YOU KNOW, I WAS ON
MY WAY HOME AND WAS IN THE AREA.

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:20.753
I JUST WANTED TO COME
SAY "HELLO."

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:22.121
THAT'S IT.
THAT IS ALL.

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:23.189
HAVE A NICE NIGHT.

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:24.490
- SUE, WHERE YOU GOING, GIRL?

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.726
YOU CAN'T LEAVE
WITHOUT COMING INSIDE.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:30.930
- OH, NO, I WOULDN'T WANT
TO BE AN INTRUSION.

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:33.132
I JUST WANTED TO SAY
"HELLO."

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:34.400
GOOD-BYE.
- OKAY, NOW, SUE.

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.035
THERE IS A SEAT
IN THIS HOUSE

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:37.570
WITH YOUR NAME ON IT, GIRL.

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.305
- NO, NO, NO,
NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:40.373
I CAN'T.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:42.041
I DIDN'T HAVE MONEY
FOR THE BUS.

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:44.644
I'M A MESS
FROM THE 50-MILE WALK.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:48.781
- NOW, WHY MUST YOU BE
SO DIFFICULT, GIRL?

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:49.849
- YOU'RE RIGHT.

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:52.318
I AM BEING DIFFICULT,
AREN'T I?

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:54.420
YOUR LIFE IS BETTER
WITHOUT ME COMING IN,

00:00:54.453 --> 00:00:55.888
TRUST ME, SO THERE I GO.

00:00:55.921 --> 00:00:59.225
- OKAY, GIRL, LISTEN,
EVERYTHING IS IRIE, MAN.

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:00.726
WE'RE GOOD FRIENDS,
ALL RIGHT?

00:01:00.759 --> 00:01:02.061
- YES, OF COURSE.

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:03.496
- AND YOU KNOW
YOU CAN SMELL IT, GIRL.

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:05.398
YOU KNOW YOU SMELL IT, GIRL.
- WHAT'S THAT SMELL?

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:06.833
- YOU KNOW YOU'RE SMELLING
THE FRIED DUMPLINGS,

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.034
THE ACKEE,
AND THE SALTFISH, GIRL.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.902
- OH.
- NOW, WHAT'S COME OVER YOU?

00:01:09.935 --> 00:01:11.804
- I SHOULD HAVE CALLED.
I SHOULD HAVE CALLED.

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:13.239
- THAT'S IT, SUE!

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:16.709
I'M FORMALLY INVITING YOU
INTO MY HOME.

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:19.112
NOW COME INSIDE.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.113
- [hisses]

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:23.216
[dramatic music]

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:24.217
[smooth jazz music]

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.352
[slurping, flesh ripping]

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:27.985
[haunting western music]

